	"data": "Xenolith Graph\n\nAI-native embeddable node-graph editor for the web. Blueprint-style with typed pins.\nRepo: <https://github.com/XenolithEngine/xenolith-graph>\nLicense: MIT\nStars: 3, 69 commits\nStatus: v0.7 BETA, active development\n\nWhat It Provides\nBlueprint-style node editor with typed pins (exec vs data)\nLive templates, macros, in-node widgets (sliders, combos, toggles)\nVisual stepping debugger\nReact/Vue adapters for embedding\nBuilt-in MCP server — Claude Desktop / Cursor can build graphs…",
